ser tab.",title2:"What is it for?",description2:"All sites should have unique favicons and your site is not exception. Get that file as part of business package."},watermarks:{tip:"Watermarks",title:"Watermarks",description:"Download original and grey watermarks of your logo",li1:"Original and grey colors",li2:"PNG format",li3:"Updated online"},oneLogoFile:{tip:"One logo file (no transparent file)",title1:"One logo file",description:"Lite package includes one logo image file in PNG format with 1000px width. This image looks the same as you can see as first picture on preview. Note that image with transparent background is not included in that package.",title2:" What is it for?",li1:"Upload it in any service that doesn't require specific image resolution or transparent background",li2:"You can upload it as profile picture of your company",li3:"Use it as sketch of your logo and show it to designer"},freeEditingForThreeMonths:{tip:"Unlimited changes within 3 months",title1:"Change logo unlimited times",description1:"You can change and download logo files unlimited times within 3 months after purchase.",title2:"What is it for?",description2:"Any part of logo can be changed when you'll apply it in real life. We give you risk-free, unlimited logo editor for 3 months."},cardBlanksEnvelopes:{tip:"Business cards, letterheads and envelopes",title1:"Business documents with your logo",description1:"Get instant access to download branded documents with your logo and information:",li1:"Personal and business cards in PDF format with your logo, name, position and contacts",li2:"Letterheads in PDF and DOCX formats with your logo and company information",li3:"Envelopes in PDF with your company information",li4:"Wallpapers in PNG to use as background for conferences",description2:"You can change logo or information anytime and download updated files immediately",title2:"What is it for?",description3:`You can use business package files to print business and personal cards.
